

SERVICES(5)          UNIX Programmer's Manual         SERVICES(5)



NAME
     services - Internet service name database

DESCRIPTION
     The file /etc/services maps service names to port numbers and
     protocols; it is consulted by getservbyname(3).  Each line is:

          name   port/protocol   [alias ...]

     as in

          telnet   23/tcp
          domain   53/udp   nameserver

     Fields are separated by spaces or tabs.  Blank lines and text
     from a `#' to the end of line are ignored.

FILES
     /etc/services

SEE ALSO
     getservbyname(3)



